  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The leading multi-center open ICU dataset — 200k+ admissions across 208 US hospitals, enabling generalisation studies not possible with single-center datasets like MIMIC-IV. Published in Scientific Data (2018). Access requires free PhysioNet credentialing and DUA signature. Adopt alongside MIMIC-IV for any critical care AI work requiring external validation or hospital-level heterogeneity.",
